{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "03269",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.07,
      "end_seconds": 6.71,
      "duration_seconds": 5.64,
      "text": "Actually, doctor? Hello, I hope this is the right time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.48,
      "end_seconds": 13.47,
      "duration_seconds": 4.99,
      "text": "Yes, come in and sit down. What brings you here today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 15.49,
      "end_seconds": 20.47,
      "duration_seconds": 4.98,
      "text": "So, doctor, it's breathlessness. It's getting on my nerves now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 22.2,
      "end_seconds": 25.54,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "How long has it been like this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 26.59,
      "end_seconds": 30.06,
      "duration_seconds": 3.47,
      "text": "It's been four weeks, I'm fairly sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 30.47,
      "end_seconds": 33.62,
      "duration_seconds": 3.15,
      "text": "Mm, okay. How frequently does it come?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 34.4,
      "end_seconds": 36.31,
      "duration_seconds": 1.91,
      "text": "It comes and goes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 37.49,
      "end_seconds": 40.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.61,
      "text": "Does anything else come with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 44.91,
      "end_seconds": 53.75,
      "duration_seconds": 8.84,
      "text": "A gurgling chest goes along with it, most of the time. The gurgling chest? That's been for two months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 54.34,
      "end_seconds": 57.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.3,
      "text": "Alright, how troublesome is it day to day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 62.61,
      "end_seconds": 68.89,
      "duration_seconds": 6.28,
      "text": "sorry, what was I saying, pretty severe, if I'm being honest"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 69.13,
      "end_seconds": 69.92,
      "duration_seconds": 0.79,
      "text": "Mm-hmm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 71.87,
      "end_seconds": 84.44,
      "duration_seconds": 12.57,
      "text": "I've been coughing up large amounts of blood too, for two weeks as for coughing up large amounts of blood, mostly mild it happens on and off"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 92.23,
      "end_seconds": 96.18,
      "duration_seconds": 3.95,
      "text": "Have you noticed fever, chest pain or weight loss?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 96.89,
      "end_seconds": 100.61,
      "duration_seconds": 3.72,
      "text": "No, um, I'd have said so."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 102.18,
      "end_seconds": 106.66,
      "duration_seconds": 4.48,
      "text": "what about your tummy and bowels, anything unusual there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 111.88,
      "end_seconds": 113.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.07,
      "text": "No, all normal there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 114.46,
      "end_seconds": 117.51,
      "duration_seconds": 3.05,
      "text": "And your skin, any changes there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 119.35,
      "end_seconds": 121.9,
      "duration_seconds": 2.55,
      "text": "nothing on the skin, no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 137.42,
      "end_seconds": 140.89,
      "duration_seconds": 3.47,
      "text": "Let me ask about allergies, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 142.63,
      "end_seconds": 146.01,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "no, I'm not allergic to anything"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 147.01,
      "end_seconds": 150.44,
      "duration_seconds": 3.43,
      "text": "Has anyone ever diagnosed you with something?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 151.98,
      "end_seconds": 161.77,
      "duration_seconds": 9.79,
      "text": "Gout, for nearly five years. I have low haemoglobin. I've been reading about it online and it worried me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 163.29,
      "end_seconds": 170.73,
      "duration_seconds": 7.44,
      "text": "Okay, yes, gout is known to us, good to have that clear. Do you follow any particular diet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 172.22,
      "end_seconds": 175.78,
      "duration_seconds": 3.56,
      "text": "I'm vegetarian and have been for years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 177.05,
      "end_seconds": 178.89,
      "duration_seconds": 1.84,
      "text": "Who lives with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 180.02,
      "end_seconds": 182.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "My partner and our baby."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 183.13,
      "end_seconds": 187.06,
      "duration_seconds": 3.93,
      "text": "Okay, what operations have you had, if any?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 190.71,
      "end_seconds": 197.06,
      "duration_seconds": 6.35,
      "text": "Yes, I had a mole taken off my arm, a few years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 212.16,
      "end_seconds": 217.63,
      "duration_seconds": 5.47,
      "text": "Alright, can you list what you take, tablets, creams or inhalers?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 219.65,
      "end_seconds": 223.02,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "Febuxostat i take it once a day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 228.31,
      "end_seconds": 230.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.64,
      "text": "alright, do you know the dose?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 232.29,
      "end_seconds": 236.87,
      "duration_seconds": 4.58,
      "text": "80 milligrams. I take iron tablets, once a day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 237.13,
      "end_seconds": 241.46,
      "duration_seconds": 4.33,
      "text": "Mm-hmm. Let me get the readings out of the way."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 253.05,
      "end_seconds": 255.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "That's it, just a a little longer..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 277.47,
      "end_seconds": 284.26,
      "duration_seconds": 6.79,
      "text": "Okay: respiratory rate 26, pulse 85, saturation 89 percent, BP is 138 over 85."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 286.9,
      "end_seconds": 289.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.7,
      "text": "Let's move on to the examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 290.48,
      "end_seconds": 292.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "I'm just checking this side"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 303.36,
      "end_seconds": 308.93,
      "duration_seconds": 5.57,
      "text": "You are pale, breathing fast and bringing up fresh blood with every cough."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 312.14,
      "end_seconds": 328.81,
      "duration_seconds": 16.67,
      "text": "You can sit up now. Let me tell you where I've got to. It points towards life-threatening haemoptysis. I want to be honest that this is an impression, not a final answer. I'll request urgent blood tests, it'll help with bleeding."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 329.87,
      "end_seconds": 333.1,
      "duration_seconds": 3.23,
      "text": "I can book that for Monday at 9 am."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 333.61,
      "end_seconds": 360.49,
      "duration_seconds": 26.88,
      "text": "I'll request an urgent CT scan, it'll help with massive haemoptysis. For this, tranexamic acid, 1 gram, now, single dose. That should help with haemoptysis. The pharmacy will go through the details again when you pick it up. Lie on the bleeding side and I am calling the emergency team. Let's get you seen by the emergency team, I'll arrange the letter."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 361.27,
      "end_seconds": 363.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "Alright, um, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 364.25,
      "end_seconds": 366.46,
      "duration_seconds": 2.21,
      "text": "Book a review straight away."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 368.36,
      "end_seconds": 370.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "Good, I'll return then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 372.1,
      "end_seconds": 374.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "Have I covered everything you wanted?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 376.41,
      "end_seconds": 381.34,
      "duration_seconds": 4.93,
      "text": "okay, uh, that makes sense thanks for explaining"
    }
  ]
}